 "remarks": "PRICE REDUCED & BACK ON THE MARKET - DON'T MISS IT!  Discover the best of North Stamford living in this charming 3+ bedroom, 3-bathroom home nestled on a beautiful, private property just off Long Ridge Road. Perfect for a young family, first-time buyer, or those looking to enjoy a peaceful retirement without giving up convenience.  The spacious 9-room home offers 3 bedrooms with the option to convert an additional room into a 4th bedroom, abundant natural light, large living and family rooms, and a recently renovated primary bathroom featuring a brand-new whirlpool tub. The kitchen includes stainless steel appliances, skylights, and ample storage, while first-floor laundry adds everyday convenience.  Enjoy your morning coffee on the front porch, entertain or barbecue on the large back deck, and take in the peaceful surroundings filled with mature trees and wildlife. A 2-car garage plus additional parking provides plenty of space for family and guests.  Minutes from the Merritt Parkway, schools, shopping, restaurants, public transportation, and everything Stamford has to offer.  Price reduced and back on the market - this North Stamford opportunity won't last. Schedule your showing today!",
